WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
There is no need to discuss this matter, Xiao Chen

2
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,580
from now on

3
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,380
Xiao Chen is your life assistant no matter where you go

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,380
You have to take her dad with you

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,380
Security aspects

6
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:13,580
Must listen to her

7
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,580
If Xiao Chen told me

8
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,180
You don't cooperate with her work

9
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,780
Then you prepared a two-year development plan

10
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,450
Just don't ask me to sign

11
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:23,050
And starting from today

12
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,650
Your car will be driven by Xiao Chen

13
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,450
You are not allowed to drive by yourself again

14
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:27,650
Give her the car keys

15
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:31,830
You won't even let me drive the car.

16
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:34,810
This matter is settled like this Xiao Chen

17
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,140
I’ll leave the rain letter to you

18
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,140
If she disobeys

19
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,340
You call me directly

20
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,340
I'll take care of her

21
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:54,060
are you calling me

22
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:55,260
I don’t ask you to call anyone

23
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,660
Is there anyone else here besides you?

24
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,380
My name is Chen Yundong

25
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,500
What your name is has nothing to do with me

26
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:02,670
I just want to know

27
00:01:02,870 --> 00:01:05,270
Where did my dad find you and bring you to my home?

28
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:07,620
Are you deliberately going around in circles with me?

29
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:11,660
Let me ask you what kind of job you did before, Wu Yi Wu Yi

30
00:01:11,860 --> 00:01:13,330
Then let me ask you

31
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:15,330
How much does my dad give you a month?

32
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:16,960
No matter how much my dad gives you

33
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:18,360
I pay double

34
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:25,110
You took the money and immediately disappeared from me. Do you understand?

35
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:26,500
Give me the car keys

36
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:28,410
car keys

37
00:01:28,810 --> 00:01:30,530
Why should I give you the car keys?

38
00:01:31,410 --> 00:01:32,410
from now on

39
00:01:32,610 --> 00:01:34,210
I will protect your safety 24 hours a day

40
00:01:34,610 --> 00:01:35,870
I'll drive your car

41
00:01:37,370 --> 00:01:39,690
Where are you going? Tell me how.

42
00:01:40,610 --> 00:01:41,810
Are you ordering me?
